WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.069 --> 00:00:22.191
This is a brand-new iPad, with Matdo Check just installed.

2
00:00:22.191 --> 00:00:28.712
It has found this center’s backups already in your iCloud.

3
00:00:28.712 --> 00:00:35.036
Tap Restore from iCloud.

4
00:00:35.036 --> 00:00:42.707
Each backup is listed by day. Pick the newest.

5
00:00:42.707 --> 00:00:49.380
Before anything is replaced, it tells you what is inside.

6
00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:56.151
The center, the attendees, and how many attendance records.

7
00:00:56.151 --> 00:01:03.050
Tap Restore This Backup.

8
00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:08.701
It downloads from iCloud. A large backup takes a while on Wi-Fi.

9
00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:24.680
Last, choose an instructor PIN for this iPad. It can be the same as before.

10
00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:32.000
The roster and every day of attendance are back.
